{"id":"amistad","lemma":"amistad","pos":"noun","rank":1451,"glosses":["friendship"],"ipa":"/amisˈtad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"amistades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-amistad.wav","examples":[{"text":"Creo en la amistad.","en":"I believe in friendship.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639162","words":[{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"¿Qué es mejor que la amistad?","en":"What is better than friendship?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645555","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"better"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Estamos todos unidos en la amistad.","en":"We're all united in friendship.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/578328","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"united","l":"unido"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Tu amistad significa mucho para mí.","en":"Your friendship has great value to me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/688961","words":[{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"to signify","l":"significar"},{"g":"much"},null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"in my opinion"]]},{"text":"No olvido a mis amistades.","en":"I don't forget my friends.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to forget","l":"olvidar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"my"},null]}]}